{"video":"J-L3Np3whu0","lines":[{"t":[0,1.3],"en":"You'll never guess what I know."},{"t":[1.4,3],"en":"Okay, let me finish this thought."},{"t":[3.7,4.7],"en":"Eric likes Megan."},{"t":[6.1,7.4],"en":"He most definitely does."},{"t":[7.9,9.8],"en":"He's been asking her out repeatedly for weeks."},{"t":[9.9,10.9],"en":"She finally said yes."},{"t":[11.1,12.6],"en":"They went out on a group date the other night."},{"t":[12.9,14],"en":"Apparently it went very well."},{"t":[15,16],"en":"How do you know this?"},{"t":[16.1,17],"en":"People tell me things."},{"t":[17.3,18.6],"en":"I guess I have a face you can trust."},{"t":[19.4,20.9],"en":"I think it's because of my low cheekbones."},{"t":[22.3,23.7],"en":"And boom."},{"t":[24,24.7],"en":"Okay, what is it?"},{"t":[24.8,25.6],"en":"What can't I guess?"},{"t":[26.8,29.2],"en":"I hate, hate, hate being left out."},{"t":[29.7,32.2],"en":"Whether it's not being picked for a team"},{"t":[32.2,34.3],"en":"or being picked for a team"},{"t":[34.3,35.5],"en":"and then showing up"},{"t":[35.5,37.3],"en":"and realizing that the team doesn't exist"},{"t":[37.3,40.2],"en":"or that the sport doesn't exist."},{"t":[41.1,42.2],"en":"I should have known."},{"t":[42.3,42.9],"en":"Poop ball?"},{"t":[44.8,46.7],"en":"Oh man, I know how you feel."},{"t":[47,47.6],"en":"Third wheel."},{"t":[47.7,50.6],"en":"I have been the third wheel so many times in my life."},{"t":[51.6,52.9],"en":"My mom told me something once"},{"t":[52.9,53.7],"en":"that made me feel a lot better."},{"t":[53.9,55.6],"en":"She said the third wheel"},{"t":[55.6,57.7],"en":"is what makes it a tricycle."},{"t":[58.3,59.2],"en":"What are you talking about?"},{"t":[59.3,60.7],"en":"I am talking about your group date"},{"t":[60.7,61.5],"en":"with Megan and Eric."},{"t":[61.7,62.3],"en":"At Tink's?"},{"t":[62.5,62.7],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[62.9,63.9],"en":"How'd you know about that?"},{"t":[64.1,64.5],"en":"Well..."},{"t":[64.5,65.5],"en":"Did Stanley tell you?"},{"t":[66.8,68.7],"en":"Stanley was on your group date?"},{"t":[69.1,70.7],"en":"No, Stanley was with his wife."},{"t":[71.1,72.6],"en":"I waved at him, but he didn't wave back."},{"t":[75,76.5],"en":"Does anybody else know about this?"},{"t":[76.7,77.1],"en":"No."},{"t":[80.7,81.8],"en":"Here he goes, here he goes."},{"t":[85,86.4],"en":"So, what is a scuttlebutt?"},{"t":[86.4,87.2],"en":"Anybody here anything?"},{"t":[90.1,90.6],"en":"Nothing?"},{"t":[91.1,92.5],"en":"I got a little something-something."},{"t":[93.3,94.6],"en":"I don't know if I should say."},{"t":[95,96.5],"en":"So, just keep it to yourself then."},{"t":[96.5,98.3],"en":"Stanley is having a midlife crisis."},{"t":[98.6,100.4],"en":"Stanley is way past the middle of his life."},{"t":[100.9,102.5],"en":"Supposedly considering his height to weight ratio."},{"t":[102.8,103.5],"en":"Well, apparently,"},{"t":[103.9,105.2],"en":"he and his wife"},{"t":[105.2,108],"en":"were out dancing at a club for young people."},{"t":[108.1,109.5],"en":"Terry's out of town, Michael."},{"t":[109.9,110.1],"en":"Who?"},{"t":[110.7,111.7],"en":"Stanley's wife, Terry."},{"t":[112,114.5],"en":"She's at an interior decorating expo in Philly."},{"t":[115.1,117.4],"en":"And Stanley hates crowds, kids, and music."},{"t":[117.9,119.5],"en":"I think you should check your facts."},{"t":[127.1,129.4],"en":"You stupid son of a bitch."},{"t":[129.4,130.2],"en":"You set me up."},{"t":[130.7,131.5],"en":"What are you talking about?"},{"t":[131.8,133.2],"en":"Stanley's wife is out of town."},{"t":[133.4,134.2],"en":"He was with somebody."},{"t":[134.5,135.5],"en":"He was definitely with someone."},{"t":[135.7,136.3],"en":"Oh, was he?"},{"t":[136.5,136.9],"en":"Well, who?"},{"t":[137.1,137.7],"en":"His sister?"},{"t":[139.3,140.5],"en":"I don't get it!"},{"t":[141.1,141.9],"en":"If that was his sister,"},{"t":[142,143.7],"en":"then what they were doing was totally illegal."},{"t":[145.1,145.5],"en":"Drugs?"},{"t":[147.4,148.1],"en":"Making out."},{"t":[154.1,155],"en":"Oh, okay."},{"t":[156.5,156.9],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[159.3,159.7],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[160.5,160.9],"en":"No, okay."},{"t":[161.1,161.6],"en":"No, it's okay."},{"t":[162.8,163.4],"en":"Never mind."},{"t":[163.6,164],"en":"Carry on."},{"t":[164.6,166.1],"en":"Stanley is having an affair."},{"t":[166.6,167],"en":"What?"},{"t":[167.4,169.2],"en":"I am very happy right now."},{"t":[169.7,170.9],"en":"Thrilled, perhaps,"},{"t":[171.1,172.6],"en":"to be a part of the office,"},{"t":[172.8,174.1],"en":"to be a part of the conversation."},{"t":[174.4,176.2],"en":"When you have somebody's attention"},{"t":[176.2,178.1],"en":"and their eyes are lighting up"},{"t":[178.1,179.6],"en":"because they are very interested"},{"t":[179.6,180.7],"en":"in what you have to say,"},{"t":[181,182.1],"en":"that is a great feeling."},{"t":[182.3,184.5],"en":"And I experienced that firsthand today."},{"t":[184.6,185.7],"en":"It is wonderful"},{"t":[185.7,187.7],"en":"to be the center of attention."},{"t":[187.9,189.4],"en":"That and that are the same letter."},{"t":[190.3,190.7],"en":"Q."},{"t":[191.9,192.4],"en":"No."},{"t":[193,193.5],"en":"No."},{"t":[193.9,194.3],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[194.5,195.4],"en":"He's holding a pencil."},{"t":[195.7,197.3],"en":"He could be doing a crossword puzzle"},{"t":[197.3,198],"en":"with that pencil."},{"t":[198.3,199.1],"en":"What's that letter?"},{"t":[199.2,199.8],"en":"Right there."},{"t":[200,201.3],"en":"Same letter here and here."},{"t":[201.8,203],"en":"What haven't you guessed?"},{"t":[203.3,203.5],"en":"T."},{"t":[203.9,204.3],"en":"T!"},{"t":[204.5,205],"en":"Yes!"},{"t":[205.9,206.3],"en":"Yes!"},{"t":[206.7,208.5],"en":"That is a T."},{"t":[208.8,210.9],"en":"And there's another one right there."},{"t":[211.1,212.3],"en":"Just sound that out."},{"t":[212.6,213.3],"en":"You're almost there."}]}
